Meet the 8-week-old cub from Loch Lomond who''s making his very first TV appearance. Or is it ''she''? So far, no one knows!', '1985-02-21', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
