The main story of this episode is a repeat of episode #2796.', '1992-12-14', 55, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:39Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:39Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('1b3f4014-3e09-4b1c-90fe-07e292e11416', 'db555b98-87d6-4cd2-b7b4-973f9206cb1e', 5, 'Liar, Liar, Friendships on Fire', 'The day trip to Beverly Hills continues and Shannon surprises the group with tourist clothes and a double decker bus ride through Hollywood. Meanwhile, Tamra confronts Braunwyn, Emily leaves the trip early, and Braunwyn has dinner with her mom.', '2019-09-03', 44, '/kMJM1n9wkm3Wy5WibtzwjGpMMyN.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:34Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:34Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('1b3fc66b-61a4-41ae-837c-6b63b5b40081', '787dfa0b-c827-4dad-a82d-0548a6534d88', 11, 'A Psychic Surprise', 'Back in the OC, Shannon and David discover that disciplining their kids is easier said than done. Vicki learns that Brooks has made a life altering decision, to stop chemo and try a radical new approach. Meanwhile, Tamra''s psychic makes a shocking claim leaving the ladies in disbelief.', '2015-08-17', 44, '/7KJ2Thxm1RVqor5WeoR1PbXEReJ.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:32Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:32Z');
