Note: HIT Entertainment pulled this episode in 2016, because an image of the Quran is briefly depicted being tripped\/stepped on at one point in the episode. However, it is still available to watch on Netflix in the U.K. until September 30th, 2017', '2014-05-17', 10, '/260yHT45alhz9iQ509eFyxamX1a.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:14:40Z', '2026-04-03T17:14:40Z');
