After 437 years in the mud at the bottom of The Solent the Mary Rose is riding high and proud on a barge in No 3 Dock at Ports-mouth Royal Naval Base. SIMON and SARAH report on the complicated preservation programme, masterminded by senior archaeologist Margaret Rule and her team.', '1982-11-18', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z');
