A look at some of the toys to be shown next month at the Harrogate International Toy Fair.', '1960-12-12', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:47Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:47Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('23339ec1-3fbb-47e3-ae72-01d25f6437ca', '991e78f1-03a5-4d26-8f75-75e11db4243c', 13, 'When Things Get Broken: Rolling Ball Sculptures of George Rhoads', 'Rogers visits the studio of George Rhoads. He watches as Rhoads demonstrates one of his mechanical ball inventions. A co-worker shows Rogers around to see various men at work on these machines. In the Neighborhood of Make-Believe, King Friday returns, not at all pleased by HulaMouse''s absence. At the height of his anger, he breaks a toy that Lady Aberlin has brought.', '1999-05-10', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:48Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:48Z');
