Join in with carols round the tree with the children of Allfarthing''s School, Warlingham County Secondary School and the Band of the Chalk Farm branch of the Salvation Army, and see if you can spot your card among the display in the studio.', '1980-12-22', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z');
