This is the last episode to be aired in black and white. In addition this is the only season to be broadcast this way and is also the only season with more than a hundred episodes in a single year.', '1968-08-16', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:38Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:38Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('32c7de31-8a32-444d-88da-cfa3f7cbdeb8', 'a31fa1d7-d649-4846-a81f-4f34b6fb3331', 24, 'Paddington Takes the Stage', 'Paddington helps the Drama Society with a performance called ''The Secret Plan''.', '1979-04-10', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:22:53Z', '2026-04-03T17:22:53Z');
