If you missed any of these milestones, join Simon, Sarah and Peter today for "Blue Peter"''s highlights of the past 12 months - plus a look forward to 1981.', '1980-12-29', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z');
