In loving memory of Emilio Delgado, our beloved Luis.', '2022-12-08', 26, '/imotGU8O11Ga3IAmPVAS3EW6LUn.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:36:51Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:51Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('45c33f78-08d6-42cc-960e-1a99bb6a3354', '38bf8c20-c17c-4071-9226-7887787cf1b1', 11, 'Pebble Trouble', 'Featuring the book ""Sylvester and the Magic Pebble"", in which a young donkey boy discovers a magic pebble in the woods, and somehow wishes himself to be a rock. His parents spend many months out looking for him, and eventually find him as the rock, and unknowingly transform him back into his old self!', '2001-04-16', 30, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:12:28Z', '2026-04-03T17:12:28Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('45c90ada-16c2-4420-a961-e27834b45446', '4900fc8d-5e7e-408e-972e-ce9269d203b3', 5, 'A Tele-Noella', 'Shannon apologizes to Heather, but her atonement doesn''t end there; Dr. Jen''s attempt to smooth things over with Noella unexpectedly blows up; Gina warns Heather about more negative comments Noella has made.', '2022-01-05', 44, '/3jP1fGQmBqIpU5rgRM1TbwLfcCX.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:35Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:35Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('45c99e32-4d8c-40a3-b0f6-c829fb38fb36', '6f731e6b-d3c5-4de6-84e1-7a19cb650e86', 38, 'Astro-Pawn', 'Get a jab in with Pawn Stars when a Civil War general''s sword slices into the shop. Will Rick get to the point and claim victory or will he fail to get an edge? Then, an 1800''s veterinary medicine box trots in. Will it cure Rick''s ailments or make him sick as a dog? Next, a pair of 1960s space toy robots rocket in. Will Chum''s excitement be over the moon or will his offer be galaxies away? And later, a 1936 Olympic pin vaults into Rick. Will he go for the gold or end up in last place?', '2016-06-15', 21, '/jkaHCr6TRlKaBcLCD27J1mpZ5DH.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:20Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:20Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('45cb62f5-8bd1-456e-8445-8b252bfaaa5b', '32192008-7529-4677-933f-c55ea6146368', 13, 'Altitude with Attitude', 'As Angel and her family prepare to move back to Colorado, she shifts her focus to hosting the ladies for their upcoming getaway. Tia goes down a tearful memory lane with her sister. Monique stirs the pot with a shady binder reveal event that sends allegations flying and puts Angel and Ashley at odds. Tensions rise as the women travel to Colorado with hopes that Angel can meet their expectations.', '2026-01-04', 42, NULL, '2026-04-03T16:35:42Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:42Z');
