Deep in the heart of the Elidir Mountain a million tons of concrete and steel reinforce an eight-mile labyrinth of tunnels and underground caverns. Simon reports from Dinorwic - Europe''s largest pumped storage power station.', '1983-02-07', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('526a06aa-c724-451b-b11e-5fc6dcca48b6', '87f84063-82b3-45a4-936c-3759e5d91ce3', 11, 'Old Testaments, New Revelations', 'In the wake of Jen''s indictment, the ladies attempt to get to the bottom of the rumors about Mary; Meredith questions her chance encounter with Cameron, while Heather and Whitney accuse Lisa of masterminding the meeting.', '2021-11-21', 44, '/5rVNLO33ZtVIxtH5P7d8yavUtnx.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:44Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:44Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('526ba223-c010-4ac4-a80c-28eac535cc47', 'd199804f-ccf5-4e36-8929-56c1e356b74d', 97, 'Episode 1022', '', '1977-04-12', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:32Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:32Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('526f7499-7103-4541-8906-f714e5a479d2', '4fe93658-c463-4329-8e64-9d523869c2cb', 3, 'Double Trouble', 'The Pawn Stars reach for the sky when a man walks in with a custom set of 19th century double barrel firearms - including a multiple caliber dual shotgun/rifle and a hand carved pistol. Will they load up and take aim at a deal or will a pair of misfires send the seller packing? Then, Rick and Chumlee are presented with an extremely rare unopened bottle of 1921 Dom Perignon Champagne. From the first year it was produced, will Rick shake up a deal and toast his good fortune or will everything just fizzle out? And later, a man comes in with a collection of autographed talking Freddy Krueger dolls from the horror classic "A Nightmare on Elm Street." Will the Old Man dream up a killer price for this trash talker or will the negotiations be a nightmare on Las Vegas Boulevard?', '2010-09-06', 21, '/aDyodDXwCPZVLhd6hQXhwpvEonx.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:16Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:16Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('527673d8-2d29-4aff-8400-5f76975b68dd', 'b8c1b631-9850-45f3-9361-cdad5571a492', 15, 'One on One: Part 1', 'The Brown family sits down individually to discuss the challenges they have faced over the past year. Kody and Christine give insight about their separation, while Meri learns of an instance when Kody thought about reconciling.', '2022-12-18', 42, '/jt94YoTwEdHjpavKTGxf8wwh1Bs.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:32Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:32Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('5276d25d-d4b7-40f6-9e52-5f64333b9a8f', 'd77eacde-5963-4285-9aec-3ddaa65f0c59', 3, 'Enemy Pie', 'LeVar observes activity in a playground to see how people do and don''t get along with each other. Ed Harris reads Enemy Pie, a story about a boy who dislikes one of his new classmates, and how his father helps bring the two boys to start a friendship by making a secret recipe Enemy Pie.', '2002-09-05', 30, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:21Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:21Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('5278408c-97d7-4508-bda2-4c400be0bb4f', 'a6ed03e0-c05f-48f8-9f56-3f1da50e1792', 35, 'Episode 1350', '', '1980-01-11', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:33Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:33Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52796c39-be10-4878-94fb-9ffaad750981', 'db555b98-87d6-4cd2-b7b4-973f9206cb1e', 17, 'Florida Fun and Fury', 'Braunwyn convinces Kelly to go on the Florida trip; Shannon shares the results of her divorce hearing; the ladies head out for a night of clubbing; Kelly insults Shannon; Tamra and Kelly try to hash things out, but it blows up in their faces.', '2019-11-26', 44, '/qzwJrE2JFfylEIYZ73N3PLosakV.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:34Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:34Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('527fc235-e095-4ca2-a712-d0d76894b391', '4060ad7f-4b8f-4393-8eb1-66a150b928b6', 7, 'It''s Sesame Circus', 'Elmo wonders what amazing and exciting act he can perform for Sesame Circus, but he''s struggling to figure it out. Then he has an idea! What if he rides his tricycle down a ramp and through a hoop? Let''s try!', '2020-12-24', 26, '/mr0AUcVuZ3LBWac435j4cpAHjFF.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:36:50Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:50Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52802ee6-7576-4b90-be4a-09ecc6520716', '6053b5c1-ce86-425c-8166-e0fcc3466061', 44, 'Episode 44', 'with Valerie Singleton, John Noakes, Peter Purves', '1970-02-16', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:50Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:50Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('5281ca58-8057-4904-947e-2d3c5e03b6c1', '02849455-d14b-476b-9603-eef5fb5d2ab3', 9, 'A Happy Medium', 'Tired of keeping Chris'' full family history from her mom, Candiace decides to face her fears. Monique organizes a donation drive for the victims of Hurricane Harvey, while an emotional Gizelle breaks down over the stress of her relationship. Robyn and Juan seek closure from their past, but a visit from past loved ones leaves the couple in extreme shock.', '2018-05-27', 42, '/eqsKqbMC3ZYzxY9kReg0xsPOagk.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:39Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:39Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52824a65-8183-4b1f-ad94-ce680c96446a', '05c0e384-194c-4417-9f62-803eb615e409', 32, 'Red Monster Pt 2: No one has ever seen a monster', 'Title number 0032. Opens with Mister Rogers arriving  with a box of masks. Mr. Rogers puts on various masks to prove he doesn''t change when he puts one on. The Neighborhood of Make-Believe is trying to trace out what is believed to be a red monster.', '1968-04-02', 28, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:38Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:38Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52837111-40a5-4dd1-86cb-06881cdc596f', 'd64c5d0c-41a0-4404-88e7-55c405302d79', 5, 'The Ghost of Harrenhal', 'The Baratheon rivalry ends; Tyrion learns of Cersei''s secret weapon; Dany suffers a loss; Arya collects a debt she didn''t know was owed.', '2012-04-29', 55, '/h7HHSQtEyf7cNBYR2G9DjQ78EgV.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:36Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:36Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('528cf145-ee75-483b-8af2-38b1304a0f92', 'bb5a8843-6181-4a6d-bfdf-33ef2c6be7b8', 9, 'The Peaches of Wrath', 'Things take an unexpected turn when Shereé invites Kim and NeNe to dinner. Porsha gets an opportunity that could take her career in a new direction. Shereé receives good news about her boyfriend, while Cynthia faces new scrutiny about her interest in Will. Annoyed with everyone''s concern about her issues with Porsha, NeNe gathers the ladies to address all the other elephants in the room.', '2018-01-14', 43, '/7m8GCd1rKND1ouvMgJBGnXlXFlP.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:48Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:48Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52938933-dba2-4890-9d8c-a6beb3861757', 'fb4ecc73-cb92-4c5c-821f-92179058b37b', 99, 'Episode 3754', '', '1998-04-02', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:41Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:41Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('5297418a-ea3b-4f9c-beac-28922d3cda0d', '27a5a980-ec0d-4637-b5ba-df8324a6405a', 10, 'Thanksgiving III', 'Frankie''s parents, Pat and Tag, invite the Hecks to spend a few days at their house to celebrate Thanksgiving together. But the festivities begin to fall apart quickly when Frankie''s sister, Janet, and her family also join in, and soon the siblings are at each other''s throats over their widely differing parenting techniques. Meanwhile, Mike tries to offer some advice to Axl on how to pick up girls when he witnesses his son trying to impress a pretty mini-mart cashier - and fails miserably; Brick attempts to prove his innocence when he is accused by Janet of damaging her daughter''s expensive toy; and Sue is stoked when Frankie, Pat and Janet invite her to take part in their gossip sessions.', '2011-11-23', 22, '/bqD8PLbqTUCBu1ucZaU1lbq1n6Z.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:29Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:29Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('529c8ed9-4c9f-4304-bb5b-d2d258c99a7a', '0ab4dfb2-58c9-4e52-b5bf-49bba0bfc597', 1, 'Pilot', 'When an unassuming high school chemistry teacher discovers he has a rare form of lung cancer, he decides to team up with a former student and create a top of the line crystal meth in a used RV, to provide for his family once he is gone.', '2008-01-20', 59, '/ydlY3iPfeOAvu8gVqrxPoMvzNCn.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:32Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:32Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52a24b02-9466-441f-9f2c-fbba6133c07b', 'edc63a59-2fd4-442a-9343-f2872d776bdc', 8, 'An Arthur Thanksgiving', 'Arthur and his family are getting ready for Thanksgiving! But when Pal disappears to go on his own adventure, family, friends and the rest of Elwood City try to get Pal home. Will they be able to celebrate the best Thanksgiving yet?', '2020-11-16', 55, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:37:54Z', '2026-04-03T17:37:54Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52a3e8ca-f32b-4f06-bbde-2e6a2e3e532e', 'f6015d9a-ece4-414a-a00b-06cf689fe40b', 2, 'Orange Badge Special!', 'It''s an orange badge special. We announce the winner of the Awesome Animation competition while launching a brand new one for Blue Peter''s big birthday in its 60th year. Also, Radzi and Sport badge holder Chloe head behind the scenes at BBC''s Sports Personality of the Year 2017.', '2018-01-11', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:22:10Z', '2026-04-03T17:22:10Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52a56684-84e2-4b99-9986-3e2234fd9d69', 'c9adc698-be92-4dd7-94ad-d8f6759361ca', 1, 'Is Santa Claus Real?', 'Rogers gives a Santa Claus costume to Chef Brockett. Both Betty Aberlin and François Clemmons talk of how as children, they used to be afraid of Santa Claus. Santa Claus, himself, also comes to the neighborhood. This is the first series episode to use the closing song "It''s Such a Good Feeling". This continued as the closing song until the end of the series in 2001.', '1973-02-19', 30, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:40Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:40Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52ab5fdb-8169-402a-a271-542b0cee46d5', 'bddd6427-4f85-402c-b58c-5c18ab159704', 81, 'Episode 876', '', '1976-03-22', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:31Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:31Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52b06783-ce68-4c7f-a407-00bada80e82c', '9ae29d08-7ce8-47f9-8584-2d3e861067a8', 3, 'I.F.T.', 'Walt ignores Skyler''s demands, furthering the rift between them and pushing her to break bad. Still suffering from panic and anxiety attacks, Hank crosses a line at work.', '2010-04-04', 48, '/jH2nkMFxuX5tXc832jyDNU4AjKq.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:33Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:33Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52b44f5a-1311-4fb7-bfd1-a1c4a267bb88', '7c422193-b078-49d8-81ef-f2b9f94f059d', 16, 'The Count gets the counting flu (repeat)', 'Episode #3021

The main story of this episode is a repeat of episode #2809.', '1992-11-30', 55, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:39Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:39Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52be7f0b-15a3-4b97-a4fa-69dbd56d28c9', '06030129-ff2d-4490-b66c-9f41bbe7aabd', 8, 'Washing', 'It''s a rainy day on the Ragdoll, and John''s in need of washing his clothes, so he sets out to a local launderette to get them clean once again. Rosie and Jim have some dirty washing too, but they also have something else in mind.', '1990-10-22', 15, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:19:36Z', '2026-04-03T17:19:36Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52becf13-21d6-4a0b-88c7-7b880532810c', '9193e795-da7c-40ec-b68f-f63aa7d5174f', 174, 'Histories & Lore: The Blackfyres', 'Varys explains the backstory of House Blackfyre.', '2019-12-03', 6, '/hONNT8vXmERepBV0b6iv6votE1s.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:35Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:35Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52c76ca2-3cfe-4dd4-ad9b-c9153a9a1d85', '1d713ca6-4e17-4f84-949c-8cfd98514127', 41, 'Clowning Around', 'Saddle up with the Pawn Stars when a Gene Autry guitar struts into the shop. Will Corey and Chum pony up the money for the "Singing Cowboy" item, or will the deal be out of tune? Then, Rick starts clowning around when a Red Skelton portrait comes in. Will Rick be laughing all the way to the bank, or will he suspect some funny business? And later, when Chum decides to sell his shoe collection in the shop, Rick has other ideas. Will Chum''s business deal get up and running or will it cause a big stink?', '2014-12-18', 21, '/4g9TK1dx0QOtD46r3azIDAQvXE7.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:19Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:19Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52ca9b4e-fe0b-498c-8923-4e4e3cc7d1e5', '9b144910-398a-47d4-9ccd-823d25cc8b0a', 10, 'Temporary Shrinkage', 'Kathy tries to find love for her sister at the gay bar; Teresa and her brother, Joe discuss their issues in therapy; Jacqueline and Caroline discuss whether Teresa and her husband are still invited to the Napa trip; Rosie visits Teresa.', '2012-07-01', 43, '/c1qWXVaJ8HTns74oN5GrJpgSazj.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:15Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:15Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('52cbf643-076c-490a-86df-a200b913702b', '3ee646e8-23ae-4dec-bbc6-c7e6a210d55b', 118, 'The story of "The Grouches Who Lost All Their Pickles"', 'As the meeting begins, Telly starts to weep at just the title of the storybook: The Grouches Who Lost All Their Pickles. He knows how much Grouches love to eat pickles, and the thought of them running out makes him and the Grouchketeers sad. Oscar says the book could have a positive ending.

Sponsors: S, T, 13', '1991-04-24', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:38Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:38Z');
