These words greet millions of people all over the world who tune to the BBC''s World Service. John goes to Bush House and meets the broadcasters, including Hitoshii Fukuda, a Japanese newsreader, and Noel Edmonds!', '1977-12-01', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:53Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:53Z');
