In the Neighborhood of Make-Believe, the Trolley stops running in front of the castle due to the power shortage as the lights through out Make-Believe begin to fade.', '1975-03-27', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:41Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:41Z');
