Back at the house, Mister Rogers shows a short film about a birthday celebration for a 100-year-old doll which had been passed down through one family''s generations. After the film, Mister Rogers comments that "sometimes the oldest toys are the best."', '1982-05-31', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:42Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:42Z');
