The reality is - it''s just Bronson. Having collected all those strange deliveries for the past few episodes and having collected all the smells, he really is Skunkman.', '2001-04-25', 24, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:40:41Z', '2026-04-03T17:40:41Z');
