After the summer drought, the villagers of Topsham in Devon were faced with floods when the River Exe produced its highest tide since 1966.

Michael helped to build the barricades to protect the centuries-old houses and joined the men of the Devon Fire Brigade keeping anxious watch on the rising waters.', '1984-10-04', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
