Twenty-four years ago this week the first Blue Peter was transmitted. Join in the birthday celebrations and discover who has won the 1982 Award for Outstanding Endeavour.

Final nominations are being made for your Blue Peter ''Best Films''. Today''s choice goes right back into the archives with one of the earliest - and most unusual - stories ever shown.', '1982-10-14', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z');
