Six by Four: 2: Choosing the lay-out and Flexible track, a series in which Michael Humphries show you how to make a better lay-out for your model railway', '1960-11-28', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:47Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:47Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('85d3b1b8-5996-427b-b971-f06b71a5bf8c', '27947392-39ba-45a6-b67b-fc609eb26e51', 20, 'Tidal Turmoil', 'Hannah and Norman help at the Pontypandy Vets but end up losing the sheep and Prince the Horse, who gets stuck in sinking mud at the tidal flats.', '2023-05-31', 10, '/gaZ8iNKrhcBLPA2S6tKp9XOO1Kh.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:14:41Z', '2026-04-03T17:14:41Z');
