Expert Christopher Wenner has been ski-ing on and over water since he was a 14-year-old in Central America''s El Salvador. Effortless as it looks, a great deal of skill is involved, as LESLEY and SIMON discover when they have their very first water-ski lesson.', '1978-09-14', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z');
