The world''s weather has gone bonkers! Tens of millions of people in 40 countries are suffering because of droughts or floods.

If you join the Blue Peter Weather Beaters 25,000 families will have the chance to pick up the threads of normal life. All you need is an adult to agree to help and write off for a Great Blue Peter Bring and Buy Sale kit from [address removed].', '1983-11-24', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z');
