Songs  Why Can''t the Dirt Just Leave Me Alone?  Notes  Adapted as the book Dirt is Delightful!', '1997-11-04', 25, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:31Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:31Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a29d09ad-f753-45bd-82ec-e42165abcff6', 'd1863f2f-02ec-40ce-af64-db03fbe518a7', 33, 'Don''t Get Pushy', 'Telly is upset when Rosita pushes Baby Bear by accident because she is too excited; but with the help of her friends on Sesame Street, she learns how to control herself. Also featuring Cookie Monster''s Les Moussarables, and Elmo the Musical. Brought to you by the letter E and the number 11.', '2016-08-20', NULL, '/qXsZtvMf1cwudl7CdIlFEVWgNrR.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:36:48Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:48Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a29d8d43-de9f-4e3c-994f-b88ae5482201', '1756fc59-e187-4d0e-a7ba-465eafc4fba0', 11, 'The Memory Box / Too Many Treasures / Don''t Talk to Strangers', '', '1996-10-06', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:11:21Z', '2026-04-03T17:11:21Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a29e97f7-f08b-4776-baed-911cdd3de175', 'c21dbd22-5e2e-4414-bb67-750399aaf6f0', 26, 'Guns Blazing', 'Prepare for battle with the Pawn Stars as one of the rarest guns in American history pops into the shop. A 9-shot LeMat revolver used by the Confederate Army, will Rick charge into this deal guns blazing, or let it fire right past him? Then, it''s a race to the finish when a tire signed by legendary NASCAR driver Dale Earnhardt rolls on by. Will Corey be burning rubber to get this piece of racing history or will the negotiations lose their traction and hit the wall? And later, Corey and Chumlee are presented with a 1980''s handheld Donkey Kong game. The pre-cursor to Game Boy, will Chumlee go bananas over this Nintendo classic, or is it game over?', '2012-02-20', 21, NULL, '2026-04-03T16:34:17Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:17Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a29f016b-edac-4080-96f5-8a44303d92b5', '8bae6aa3-4b55-4fa6-bc15-8f4317bd1f13', 46, 'Snow People Pt 1', 'Chef Brockett presents snow pudding to Rogers at the bakery. In the Neighborhood of Make-Believe, Lady Elaine wants to make snow, but she can''t get it just right.', '1972-04-24', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:40Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:40Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a2a099ef-d209-4eeb-a29e-22f45182f684', '02849455-d14b-476b-9603-eef5fb5d2ab3', 14, 'Cannes We All Just Get Along', 'As the ladies travel to the beautiful South of France for a relaxing vacation on the French Riviera, Gizelle and Robyn clash over their accommodations. Monique opens up about her marriage, and Ashley questions Karen''s living situation.', '2018-07-08', 42, '/kMgPU8Ygnq1oVTYIEjTrP7K7BS3.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:39Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:39Z');
