SuperTed returns next week and from his space station orbiting the Earth he''s on the alert to answer any SOS that flickers on to his video monitor. If you''d like your own knitted Janet has news of a pattern that could bring him zooming on to your bed - in assorted colours!', '1984-09-27', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a67b3491-c0f1-4172-8c78-8d2e8f03d9ef', '050d8ae1-6cc1-4018-933d-b3c3d13de856', 10, 'Episode 10', 'Straight Down the Line!: Simon tracks down the most famous line in the world, the zero line of longitude - otherwise known as the Greenwich Meridian - that celebrates its centenary next Saturday. Most visitors to Greenwich admire the famous Time Ball dropped one hour after noon each day-now is your chance to see how it works and why Greenwich Mean Time is of worldwide importance.', '1984-10-11', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('a67f1280-d743-440b-8170-fbef7f9b6110', '45e01c04-6ac6-41e1-87d8-f749ee230385', 8, 'Sausages Versus Shrimps', 'Norman Price gets Trevor Evans and Tom Thomas to have a competition to see whose food tastes better. Trevor Evans puts a lot of coal on to his barbecue, soon causing some trees to catch fire.', '2008-02-19', 10, '/8P6VkA0e5H3BFGEzfzFxNExqeiq.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:14:38Z', '2026-04-03T17:14:38Z');
