Britain''s best-loved golden retriever was 5 years old last Friday. Join in the birthday celebrations, which include a flashback to Goldie''s first appearance on TV.', '1983-03-28', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:56Z');
