Expedition USA  Lesley and Simon explore the birthplace of jazz, ride a steam-boat on the mighty Mississippi and sample a Po''boy.', '1978-09-18', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba1b26c0-ff69-455e-8bb0-d52fd10f6b00', 'e3a28669-91b5-45f7-bb73-5006acc084e8', 4, 'Timmy in a Tizzy', 'Timmy the little lamb is distraught when the farmer take''s his favourite toy, can Shaun and pals get it back?', '2007-03-06', 7, '/5ucdAkaYYbyypGVG8xWxGT0XgmP.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:39:31Z', '2026-04-03T17:39:31Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba1b4d63-ee75-4654-b936-c517e0637ecb', 'd405f973-4c7e-4cb6-b7c0-d09a884c9b35', 10, 'Last Call, Morocco!', 'The wives'' Moroccan adventure continues, but there''s a bump in the riad. The aftermath of a blowout between Jill and Ramona leaves Ramona still shaken, prompting yet another confrontation. Minus Ramona, the ladies also tour lavish palaces.', '2011-06-09', 43, '/viBTlvYR5j6GjclVCkoj2tce9aM.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:22Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:22Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba1d1ed0-9d5a-468a-a0e7-170ec9a7b179', '42e591e2-2a88-4434-ae9f-3d4b1d685613', 32, 'Chum of All Fears', 'Trick R'' Treat with the Pawn Stars as Corey and Chumlee try to pull off the perfect duo Halloween costume. Can they be counted on to work as a team? Then, when Corey checks out a 1933 Plymouth, the Old Man tries to edge in on the deal. And later, a guy brings in a 1977 Mattel Electronic Football Game. A relic from Rick''s childhood, can he separate business from nostalgia?', '2013-10-31', 21, '/xHtvBPDP9wAGAsYfzerK8xBCA8X.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:34:18Z', '2026-04-03T16:34:18Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba2527fd-2032-49ac-88d9-df85f44d5212', '97a3d1f5-a8f1-47cd-8122-2e74a092836d', 3, 'Am I Blue? (3)', 'The police connect the cup in Gaby''s room to the missing spaceship. The costume is found in the toy chest. Gaby confesses that she got the money from the cashier, but has no idea how the spaceship got in her toy chest. However, no one believes her except Alex. Just as Alex confesses to the police that Gaby didn''t steal the spaceship, The producer of Galaxy Girl rushes over to tell the police that he got a note from Galaxy Girl''s #1 fans, and the police suspect Gaby again because she is Galaxy Girl''s #1 fan.', '1993-09-19', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:40:28Z', '2026-04-03T17:40:28Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba28304f-fd5e-415c-ada5-cf71a7d218fd', '939d270c-ea8e-4cc8-a5a5-e59df2c8062c', 4, 'Desert Détente', 'Sergio and Caroline Stanbury come to an impasse regarding having children together; Caroline Brooks puts plans for her spa in motion; all the ladies meet up for the first time since the disastrous party; Sergio shares some laughs with Ayan and Lesa', '2022-06-22', 44, '/8Z3phlcimspYTeNPnGzsgRas6Mi.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:07Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:07Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba2d424e-298a-4a3d-a762-b556b25697c7', 'ae373811-cd7f-4e4c-bf5f-6e5eef167f8d', 8, 'Fireworks', 'A musical celebration of the Fourth of July.', '1976-05-22', 3, '/2CsY6a9LYbcBPdwYqlXymfgNkSL.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:13:56Z', '2026-04-03T17:13:56Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba32626f-525d-4c1f-b610-7c41a33f686c', '0d24c742-83f2-4f37-8a5d-0b09c7df6a7f', 3, 'Trial by Ordeal', 'A witch trial pulls Geralt away from his quest. Ciri taps further into the darkness of her new life. Yennefer brings more recruits to her cause.', '2025-10-30', 52, '/vFD8IIbPT6xeNZVeajxLeHrybOu.jpg', '2026-04-03T15:40:46Z', '2026-04-03T15:40:46Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba389f4a-b322-4187-9ccd-80790c3b2fa1', '5db3ff78-e439-48e1-8f67-988ecbf85d17', 14, 'In Search of Juliette', 'That upstart Dogtanian has just ruined Rochefort''s plan to kidnap Juliette so he and Richelieu send 3 guards to arrest him. Planchet distracts the guards long enough for Pip to help Dogtanian and Juliette escape out the back. Pip helps out yet again when they see two more guards in front of the house, he pretends to be drunk and distracts the guards while Dogtanian and Juliette run to find Porthos at his house. Meanwhile Porthos has gone to Dogtanian''s not realising there are guards there...', '1982-01-01', 24, '/vOA2gzMh0Rgfi4VfAY1Eh0TRRFG.jpg', '2026-04-03T17:18:43Z', '2026-04-03T17:18:43Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba3bd33e-5702-4d2f-9f14-930887f9f456', 'd1d267dd-e27f-4543-acb8-0d28f676512a', 42, 'Episode 42', 'with Valerie Singleton, John Noakes, Peter Purves.', '1968-01-29', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:49Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:49Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('ba3d3524-11d5-438f-9e53-ed8bbb07495a', '65f5abc8-0c59-497b-86e5-8c6165ee480c', 17, 'Reunion (Part 1)', 'D’Andra drops a bombshell on Cary about an alleged plot to fat-shame her; Cary fires back by revealing a disparaging text D’Andra sent to Kameron; Stephanie talks about her struggles with depression; Kameron defends her behavior in Beaver Creek.', '2018-12-05', NULL, '/sRoGNz3caQCTIn2gBnTGCzbqLio.jpg', '2026-04-03T16:35:04Z', '2026-04-03T16:35:04Z');
