In Trafalgar Square crowds are flocking to see the massive Norwegian Christmas Tree - a present from the people of Oslo. Simon and Christopher follow its journey from the Forest of Nordmarka and prepare for the grand Switch-on Ceremony.', '1978-12-18', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:54Z');
