Eighty-five years ago killer lions ate 28 navvies attempting to build Kenya''s Mombasa-to-Lake Victoria railway.

Colonel J. H. Patterson ''s master plan outwitted the man-eaters and saved the day! Simon reports from Tsavo, the very spot where the lions attacked.', '1984-10-08', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
