Britain''s most popular Golden Retriever returns to the studio with her five 6-week-old puppies. They''re in good company too, with guests Kevin Keegan, Rags, the pony for handicapped riders, and Barry Tuckwell and his famous Wind Quintet.', '1981-04-27', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z');
