Elmo has to get used to his father, Louie, being back at home. Then when Louie finds out that he has to leave again, Elmo finds it hard to missed him. However, Elmo''s Mom told them that they can get through it since they have experience it before.', '2008-04-29', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:36:27Z', '2026-04-03T17:36:27Z');
