erbread man.', '2006-06-12', 30, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:12:29Z', '2026-04-03T17:12:29Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('d38238eb-5938-482e-b83a-592c3ef85010', '119c16d5-1047-45ec-8242-c72a8eed423b', 51, 'My Dad, the Garbage Man', 'Every kid at school''s parents has cool jobs except for Francine''s dad. He''s a garbage man and Francine is embarrassed by it so to make him look cool she tells the kids at school that he''s a CIA agent.', '1996-11-11', 13, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:37:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:37:55Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tv_episodes (id, tv_season_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, still_key, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('d389b889-036c-48f0-a7ed-37e90a607edf', '4a8e3db0-8068-4ff3-942f-91f45f665f20', 1, 'Pecos Bill Cleans Up the West', 'Theo reads the cubs a book about the wild adventures of Pecos Bill, specifically about the time ol'' Bill wrangled a tornado. When the tornado escapes from the book, however, and wreaks havoc inside the library, the lions realize there''s only one person who can tame that tornado: Pecos Bill, himself!', '2000-04-03', 30, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:12:27Z', '2026-04-03T17:12:27Z');
