Twenty thousand Cub Scouts entered a vigorous test of strength and endurance last year to discover the fittest and quickest thinking Cubs. Today the four winners visit the studio and challenge Simon and Michael to try the toughest test of all, the dreaded ''leg-hover''!', '1985-02-25', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
