Man has only been airborne for less than 200 years, and when it happened it was by balloon. Sarah makes her first ever ascent in a basket, in an ancestor of the historic Montgolfier balloon of 1783.', '1982-06-24', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z');
