Peter Grimshaw of Atherton started collecting them in 1946 when he was 10. Now he reckons it''s the biggest collection in the country. Watch out for the spectacular Walking Dragline, too!', '1985-04-11', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
