To restore a huge Edwardian office block in the heart of the City of London, a 100-tonne tower crane had to be swung in ten sections over a 108-foot wall! Simon joined the team masterminding this colossal leap-frog and picked up a few tips from Billy Dalton, whose precision and skill helped to make the whole manoeuvre possible.', '1984-10-18', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:57Z');
