Slippery Customers

Thirty thousand wriggling eels were Simon''s '' catch'' when he waded up to his waist at the Hamana Lagoon Eel Farm. But the problems didn''t end there - Master Chef Kyoshi Motohashi had his hands full when he showed Peter how to cook this gastronomic delicacy!', '1981-09-21', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z', '2026-04-03T17:21:55Z');
