In the Neighborhood of Make-Believe, Lady Abelrin asks Edgar Cooke about the tooth fairy but and he responds: "I don''t ever sing about secrets and the tooth fairy is a secret."', '1975-03-25', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-03T17:35:41Z', '2026-04-03T17:35:41Z');
